  "product_name_ru": "KURA® RELEASE bio",
  "product_short_desc_en": "With essential oils of camphor, mint, and capsicum. 97.2% certified natural raw materials.\nNatural ingredients and organic components.\n\nMade from our historic formula, this pain relief cream gel contains all the quality and effectiveness of the medicinal herbs we’ve been using for over 60 years. Now you have a completely natural product for minor daily aches and pains you can take with you wherever you go. Joint pain, contractures, sprains, bruises, and heaviness of the legs that will receive an immediate relief.",
  "product_short_desc_ro": "Cu uleiuri esențiale de camfor, mentă și capsicum. 97,2% materii prime naturale certificate.\nIngrediente naturale și componente organice.\n\nCreată după formula noastră istorică, această cremă-gel calmantă conține toată calitatea și eficacitatea plantelor medicinale pe care le folosim de peste 60 de ani. Acum ai un produs complet natural pentru micile dureri zilnice, pe care îl poți lua cu tine oriunde. Dureri articulare, contracturi, entorse, vânătăi și greutate în picioare care vor primi o ameliorare imediată.",
  "product_short_desc_ru": "С эфирными маслами камфоры, мяты и капсикума. 97,2% сертифицированного натурального сырья.\nНатуральные ингредиенты и органические компоненты.\n\nСозданный по нашей исторической формуле, этот обезболивающий крем-гель содержит всё качество и эффективность лекарственных трав, которые мы используем более 60 лет. Теперь у вас полностью натуральное средство от повседневных лёгких болей, которое можно взять с собой куда угодно. Боли в суставах, контрактуры, растяжения, ушибы и тяжесть в ногах получат немедленное облегчение.",
  "product_long_desc_en": {
    "root": {
      "type": "root",
      "format": "",
      "indent": 0,
      "version": 1,
      "children": [
        {
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Lotion indicated to relieve pain, it contains counterirritants, salicylates, and capsicin, whose combined action ensures greater results thanks to the ability to penetrate deep into the inflamed body area. The counterirritants are substances that create a burning and cooling sensation to distract the mind from pain and stimulate the heat receptors of skin cells; they are menthol, camphor, essential oil of eucalyptus, and cloves. The oil resin of capsicum creates a marked perception of heat, favouring blood flow to the sore area. Methyl salicylate is used as a skin vasodilator in the treatment of muscle and joint pain. Ideal for sportsmen and for all those who perform intense physical activity. Given the high content of essential oils, the use on children and pregnant women is not recommended. ",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "format": "",
          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "How to Use",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "type": "heading",
          "tag": "h4"
        },
        {
