          "indent": 0,
          "version": 1,
          "children": [
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Apply the lotion on the affected area and exercise a gentle massage to promote its absorption. Apply several times, if necessary. Always wash your hands after the application, absolutely avoid touching your eyes or mucous membranes. Never apply to eczema and open wounds. ",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "direction": null,
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
